        'clanker_vault_list':('List this requester\'s own and explicitly invited login, card and API-key handles and metadata. Invited handles can be used on the owner\'s behalf, never reshared. Available only in a private DM. Secret values are never returned.',{},[]),
        'clanker_api_request':('Call the exact HTTPS service bound to an owned or invited API-key handle. The backend adds authentication; never supply the key in the task, path, body or headers. Redirects and host-local destinations are refused. This can perform external changes: use only for the user\'s requested operation; check outcomes before retrying.',
